    <subfield code="a">"This tribute to Mistress Bradstreet was designed and letterpress printed by Margery S. Hellmann ..."--Colophon.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">An artist's book featuring an innovative page structure in which white leaves of paper have been hand-stitched to brown leaves of paper. The white leaves have had a square cut out of them revealing the text printed on the brown leaves. Text printed on the white leaves feature selections of poetry from Anne Bradstreet, whereas the brown leaves give a short biography of her. There is also a series of small pop-ups featuring her poem The author to her book.</subfield>
  </datafield>
